{
  "tema": 5041,
  "slug": "soy-de",
  "titulo": "Saying where you're from with soy de",
  "subtitulo": "«Soy de Tijuana. ¿De dónde eres?»",
  "foto": "t02.jpg",
  "regla": "To say where you're from, use soy de + city, country or region (soy is ser, never estar). Ask ¿De dónde eres? to a tú and ¿De dónde es usted? to an usted.",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-17",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "formula",
          "partes": [
            "(yo) soy",
            "+ de +",
            "city / country / region"
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Soy** is the yo form of **ser** (_to be_). **Yo** is optional."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "To ask, the **de** jumps to the front: **¿De dónde eres?** (tú), **¿De dónde es usted?** (usted)."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **de** is the root of your family tree. You come **de** somewhere, and that never changes, so it's **ser**."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ejemplos",
      "titulo": "Examples",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "==Soy de== Tijuana.",
              "en": "I'm from Tijuana."
            },
            {
              "es": "Yo ==soy de== México, ¿y tú?",
              "en": "I'm from Mexico, and you?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==De dónde eres==?",
              "en": "Where are you from?"
            },
            {
              "es": "¿==De dónde es== usted, señora?",
              "en": "Where are you from, ma'am?"
            },
            {
              "es": "==Soy de== Baja California, pero vivo en Guadalajara.",
              "en": "I'm from Baja California, but I live in Guadalajara."
            },
            {
              "es": "Mi maestro de jiu-jitsu ==es de== Brasil.",
              "en": "My jiu-jitsu teacher is from Brazil."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "trampa",
      "titulo": "The trap",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "pares",
          "lista": [
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Estoy de Tijuana."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Soy de Tijuana."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "Origin uses **ser**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "Soy desde Tijuana."
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "Soy de Tijuana."
                }
              ],
              "nota": "_From_ here is **de**, not **desde**."
            },
            {
              "filas": [
                {
                  "v": "mal",
                  "t": "¿Dónde eres de?"
                },
                {
                  "v": "bien",
                  "t": "¿De dónde eres?"
                }
              ],
              "nota": "**De** goes first."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "parientes",
      "titulo": "Related rules",
      "bloques": [
